reast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">장학생 선발 절차</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:33.8pt;text-indent:-33.8pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">학생은 신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">별첨 서식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2]</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 작성하여 산학협력단 연구과제담당자 확인을 받은 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">연구과제교수 및 학과장의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">추천을 받아 해당학과 행정실로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:33.5pt;text-indent:-33.5pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">학과장은 학생처로 추천명단 및 신청서를 공문으로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:34.2pt;text-indent:-34.2pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">학생처는 추천자 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">중에서 직전학기 평점평균과 이수학점이 높은 순으로 장학생을 선발하여 해당 학과로 통보</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:80.5pt;text-indent:-80.5pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">의무사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">장학생으로 최종 선발된 학생은 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">연구참여기간 종료 후 참여 결과보고서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">별지 서식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">3]</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 제출하여야 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">. (1</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">일까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.5pt;text-indent:-19.5pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">9. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">장학생 추천시 유의사항 </sp